==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Named after {{w|Vitus Bering}}, the first European to systematically explore it.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈbɛɹɪŋ ˈsiː/}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=[[Bering]] [[sea|Sea]]}}

# The sea between [[Siberia]] and [[Alaska]], north of the [[Pacific Ocean]], that is connected to the [[Arctic Ocean]] by the [[Bering Strait]].
#: {{syn|en|Imarpik Sea}}

